step.action:
Read junit.xml ({output_folder}/{story_id}/reports/junit.xml):
      - Count {total_tests}, {passed_tests}, {failed_tests}
      - Compute {actual_pass_rate} = {passed_tests} / {total_tests} * 100 (round to 1 decimal)

check.output:
✅ Validation Passed — /aiqa-generatereport

All 8 quality checks passed. QA reports are accurate and complete.
Suite      : {suite_name}
Pass rate  : {actual_pass_rate}% (threshold: {min_pass_rate}%)
Bug count  : {actual_bug_count}
Quality gate: {PASSED if actual_pass_rate >= min_pass_rate else FAILED}
No issues found — QA cycle complete for suite "{suite_name}".
